    </span>
    <span class="b1">)</span>
    <sup class="raised">3</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     90°
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1
     <i>rad</i>
    </span>
    −
    <b>sin</b>
    ( 90° )
   </span>
   − 0.707
   <i>m</i>
   = 0.119
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Perimeter</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>P</var>
